# Note: .claude/agents/ and .github/agents/ are workspace junctions linked to shared runtime
# sources (per docs/project-worktree-parity-governance.md). They MUST be present in derived
# worktrees. We do NOT ignore the directories themselves; only purely-local sub-state is ignored.
